%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: NoMoreEyeball
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I dunno!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177878
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How <i>did</i> you guys get it up from Saarthal, anyway-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177879
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Nerien suddenly teleports in.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177882
    - rid: 268099795830177884
    - rid: 268099795830177885
    - rid: 268099795830177895
    - rid: 4972360475574796446
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: We knew you would succeed, your victory here justifies our belief in
      you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177899
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, hello again.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177897
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you going to do something about the Eye?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177898
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed. It has grown unstable and cannot remain here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: If left alone, it may destroy this college or even the world.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177900
    - rid: 268099795830177901
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: It must be secured, Ancano's actions prove that the world is not yet
      ready for something <i>this</i> powerful.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177902
    - rid: 268099795830177903
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: We shall safeguard it, for now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177904
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: You now have the opportunity to return to your daily lives-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, and best of luck to you, Arch-Mage Ervine.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177905
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Nerien teleports away, seemingly taking the Eye with him back to Artaeum.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177907
    - rid: 268099795830177908
    - rid: 268099795830177909
    - rid: 268099795830177910
    - rid: 268099795830177911
    - rid: 268099795830177912
    - rid: 4972360475574796447
    - rid: 268099819477139583
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: A shame. I would've preferred to study it more...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177913
    - rid: 268099795830177914
    - rid: 268099795830177916
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: No matter. I've got to appoint my new Master Wizard and organize my new
      chambers.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177915
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks for the help, you two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177917
    - rid: 268099795830177918
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: If I may...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Mirabelle extends her hand toward Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177919
    - rid: 268099795830177920
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: The Staff. It's for the best if such an artifact isn't in the hand of
      apprentices, no?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177921
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: No offense.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: It will be safely stored deep in the Midden, that way any experiments
      will be... distanced from the other students.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177922
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: For safety, of course.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177923
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You're not gonna go on a power-mad rampage, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177924
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177925
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Apprentice, I'm aware you've only been a student here for three days.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: By that logic, you are significantly less trustworthy than I.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177926
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ehehe... I guess so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori hands over the Staff of Magnus to Mirabelle.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177927
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: One more thing before I go...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177928
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Mirabelle turns toward Yuri.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: I've heard from Urag that you've been interested in teleportation and
      telepathy, correct?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... y-yes, Ms. Ervine.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177929
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Those topics are related to the abandoned school of Mysticism...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: As thanks for the both of your help, here-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Mirabelle hands Yuri a slightly faded, unlabelled book.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177930
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: This an old journal that contains many insights of Mysticism, some of
      which should match what you're looking for.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177931
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you, Ms. Ervine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course, farewell you two.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With a lot on her plate, Mirabelle leaves to get to work.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177932
    - rid: 268099795830177933
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177934
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177935
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You're gonna start going through that-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177938
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>Achoo</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177936
    - rid: 268099795830177937
    - rid: 268099795830177939
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hoo...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177940
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177941
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: 'To answer your question, Sayori: yes, I think I will.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177942
    - rid: 268099795830177944
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Neat!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177945
    - rid: 268099795830177946
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177947
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll go grab our dinner!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177948
    - rid: 268099795830177949
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Right... thank you, Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177950
    - rid: 268099795830177951
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri heads to the Arcanaeum to dive into her newly acquired journal and
      Sayori heads out to go grab dinner.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177952
    - rid: 268099795830177953
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
